geo-test.mmdb is MaxMind's GeoIP2-City-Test.mmdb, copied unchanged from
https://github.com/maxmind/MaxMind-DB (test-data/GeoIP2-City-Test.mmdb).
MaxMind-DB is dual-licensed under the Apache License 2.0 or the MIT License.
The test data is fictional sample data, not a real GeoIP database.
Entries used by the tests: 216.160.83.56 (US, WA, Milton),
81.2.69.142 (GB, ENG, London).
